            "review_title": "Review at Thanh Cao Restaurant",
            "review_text": "DodgeyAus\nLoxton, Australia533 contributions\n0\nQuite nice\nJan 2023 • Solo\nProbably more a 3 and a half, but that may have been what I ordered. The staff were friendly enough and the meal came out reasonably quickly. I had a glass of the local red and a serve of fried rice. The rice was nice, but I was expecting a lot more flavour. I'm not sure whether this is because from my brief bit of research, fried rice is apparently milder in Vietnam, or whether it was because they're located near the tourist area and \"westernised\" it. I'll know more when we get away from the traditional tourist areas. This was the first fried rice I've eaten here.\nRead more\nWritten January 19, 2023",
